      ],
      "image": "assets/images/212704/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a skillet over medium heat. Add onion, celery, scallions, pear, and garlic; cook and stir until vegetables are tender, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UnXW_fpUXZpxy7-p2Dqk791-jJQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-212704-semi-homemade-stuffing-VAT-4x3-step-02-c27aadbf1d404da596e0c3063edcd903.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/212704/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
